     {
      "id": "c1d01b8a-4071-456c-b276-4ec7dfc90346",
      "kind": "native",
      "name": "Panel",
      "nickName": "Summary",
      "pivot": [
       7823.373046875,
       3033.279052734375
      ],
      "text": "\nVariant\n-----------\n\nComponents\n###########\n\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  @hybr                                                     |   @pers                                                    |   @idht                                                    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  @vent                                                     |   @equi                                                    |   @idcl                                                    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  @sve1                                                     |   @ligh                                                    |   @alht                                                    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  @sve2                                                     |   @othe                                                    |   @alcl                                                    |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  @infi                                                     |                                                            |                                                            |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n\n\nResults\n########\n\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n|  |map|                                                     |   |scatter|                                                |   |thermalload|                                            |\n+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+\n\n.. |intro| image:: png\\Intro_@aname.png\n    :width: 350pt\n    :height: 200pt\n\n.. |map| image:: png\\@projvar_MAP.png\n   :width: 350pt\n   :height: 150pt\n\n.. |scatter| image:: png\\@projvar_SCATTER.png\n   :width: 350pt\n   :height: 200pt\n\n.. |thermalload| image:: png\\@projvar_TL.png\n   :width: 350pt\n   :height: 100pt\n\n.. |sv1| replace:: |sv1ico| Stack Ventilation 1\n\n.. |sv2| replace:: |sv2ico| Stack Ventilation 2\n\n.. |ven| replace:: |venico| Mechanical Ventilation\n\n.. |hyb| replace:: |hybico| Hybride Ventilation\n\n.. |inf| replace:: |infico| Infiltration\n\n.. |per| replace:: |perico| Persons Gain\n\n.. |equ| replace:: |equico| Equipment Gain\n\n.. |aux| replace:: |auxico| Other Gain\n\n.. |lig| replace:: |ligico| Lighting Gain\n\n.. |idh| replace:: |idhico| Static Heating\n\n.. |idc| replace:: |idcico| Static Cooling\n\n.. |alh| replace:: |alhico| Active Layer Heating\n\n.. |alc| replace:: |alcico| Active Layer Cooling\n\n.. |alcico| image:: png\\ACCL.png\n\n.. |sv1ico| image:: png\\SV1.png\n\n.. |alhico| image:: png\\ACHT.png\n\n.. |idcico| image:: png\\IDCL.png\n\n.. |idhico| image:: png\\IDHT.png\n\n.. |ligico| image:: png\\LIGH.png\n\n.. |auxico| image:: png\\AUXI.png\n\n.. |equico| image:: png\\EQUI.png\n\n.. |perico| image:: png\\PEOP.png\n\n.. |infico| image:: png\\INFI.png\n\n.. |hybico| image:: png\\HYBR.png\n\n.. |venico| image:: png\\VENT.png\n\n.. |sv2ico| image:: png\\SV2.png\n\n",
      "type": "GH_Panel"
     },
     {
      "id": "c5c773e7-066f-4943-80a8-d7f95408180e",
      "kind": "native",
      "name": "Panel",
      "nickName": "Summary",
      "pivot": [
       7810.93896484375,
       3343.842041015625
      ],
      "text": "\nZone: @aname - Variante: @longvarname\n--------------------------------------------------------------\n\n|intro@aname|\n\nGeometrie \n##############################\n\n============================== ======================================================================\nBodenfläche:                    @area_floor m² (@areafrac_fl_act % aktiviert)\nDeckenfläche:                   @area_ceiling m² (@areafrac_cl_act % aktiviert)\nFensterfläche                   @area_window m² (S = @area_win_s m², W = @area_win_w m², N = @area_win_n m², O = @area_win_e m²)\nAussenwandfläche:               @area_outwall m² (S = @area_out_s m², W = @area_out_w m², N = @area_out_n m², O = @area_out_e m²) \nReferenzfläche (Raumvolumen):   @refarea m² (@volume m³)\n============================== ======================================================================\n\nErgebnisse - Komfort\n##############################\n\n|scatter@aname|\n\n==================== ============================================================\nAtop =               Operative Temperatur (Nutzungszeit)\n-------------------- ------------------------------------------------------------\n\n==================== ============================================================\n\nErgebnisse - Energiebedarf\n##############################\n\n|thermalload@aname|\n\n==================== ============================================================\nHeizung =            Heizenergiebedarf - Lüftung, Konvektor, Flächenheizung\nKuehlung =           Kühlenergiebedarf - Lüftung, Konvektor, Flächenkühlung\nStrom =              Strombedarf - Lüftung, Flächenheizung, Kunstlicht, Geräte\n==================== ============================================================\n\nErgebnisse - Winterwoche\n##################################\n\n|wtsequ@aname|\n\n|wpsequ@aname|\n\n==================== ============================================================\nTamb =               Aussenlufttemperatur\nTop, Tdp =           Operative Temperatur, Taupunkttemperatur \nQ_heat =             Konvektorheizung\nQ_alfl_ht =          Flächenheizung\nQ_ahu_sen_ht =       Heizung Zuluft mech. Lüftung\n==================== ============================================================\n\nErgebnisse - Sommerwoche\n##################################\n\n|stsequ@aname|\n\n|spsequ@aname|\n\n==================== ============================================================\nTinal1 =             Vorlauftemperatur akt. Fläche\nToutal =             Rücklauftemperatur akt. Fläche\nQ_cool =             Konvektorkühlung\nQ_alfl_cl =          Flächenkühlung\nQ_ahu_sen_cl =       Kühlung Zuluft mech. Lüftung\n==================== ============================================================\n\n.. |intro@aname| image:: png\\Intro_@aname.png\n    :width: 400pt\n    :height: 400pt\n\n.. |scatter@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_SCATTER.png\n   :width: 500pt\n   :height: 300pt\n\n.. |thermalload@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_TL.png\n   :width: 460pt\n   :height: 110pt\n\n.. |wtsequ@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_WT_SEQU.png\n   :width: 435pt\n   :height: 263pt\n\n.. |wpsequ@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_WP_SEQU.png\n   :width: 435pt\n   :height: 263pt\n\n.. |stsequ@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_ST_SEQU.png\n   :width: 435pt\n   :height: 263pt\n\n.. |spsequ@aname| image:: png\\@projvar_SP_SEQU.png\n   :width: 435pt\n   :height: 263pt\n",
      "type": "GH_Panel"
     },
